abstract: >
  The exact resolved-face negation-complexity theorem nu(f) = dec(f) on the
  four-state dual-rail carrier D4, proved in the recovered resolved-face
  language and machine-verified in dependency-minimal Lean 4. Public edition
  v1.0 simplifies the proof to a single interval-shell regime via the
  unconditional containment W_f subset B_f.
keywords:
  - negation complexity
  - inversion complexity
  - dual-rail carriers
  - resolved-face transfer
  - Lean 4
